---
import IconLinks from '../../components/IconLinks.astro';
import SocialPreview from '../../components/SocialPreview.astro';
import '../../features/next-read/style.css';
const api = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_NEXT_READ_API_URL ?? 'https://next-read.astro-test.workers.dev';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
		<meta name="theme-color" content="#f6f2e9" />
		<title>Next Read — three little words, a whole other world</title>
		<IconLinks />
		<SocialPreview title="Next Read — what’s your reading mood?" description="Three little phrases. Three unexpected books. Make a tiny shelf for your very specific mood, then send it to a friend." path="/projects/next-read" image="/images/next-read/social.png" />
		<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
		<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
		<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=DM+Serif+Display:ital@0;1&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
	</head>
	<body data-api={api}>
		<a class="skip-link" href="#mood-form">Skip to your reading mood</a>
		<header class="site-header">
			<a href="/projects/next-read" class="wordmark" aria-label="Next Read home"><span class="logo-book" aria-hidden="true">n<span>r</span></span>next read<span class="wordmark-star" aria-hidden="true">✳</span></a>
			<div class="header-right"><span class="edition">a little bookish serendipity</span><button id="open-saved" class="quiet-button">Your little shelf <span id="saved-count">0</span></button></div>
		</header>
		<main>
			<section class="intro" aria-labelledby="intro-title">
				<div class="hero-copy">
					<p class="eyebrow"><span aria-hidden="true">✦</span> FOR YOUR VERY SPECIFIC MOOD</p>
					<h1 id="intro-title">Your next book.<br />A little <em>less obvious.</em></h1>
					<p class="intro-description">A feeling, a place, a beautifully weird craving.<br class="desktop-break" /> Give us three little phrases. We’ll find the books.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="book-scene" aria-hidden="true">
					<span class="scene-star star-one">✳</span><span class="scene-star star-two">✦</span>
					<div class="hero-book book-pink"><span>GET A LITTLE</span><strong>lost<br />in the<br /><i>feeling.</i></strong><span class="cover-doodle">☼</span></div>
					<div class="hero-book book-green"><span>AN INVITATION TO</span><strong>somewhere<br /><i>else.</i></strong><div class="cover-portal"></div><span class="cover-bottom">just one more chapter</span></div>
					<span class="scene-note">good things happen<br />between the covers.</span>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="mood-station" aria-label="Create your reading mood">
				<div class="station-heading"><p><span class="tiny-number">01 — 02 — 03</span> A little of this. A little of that.</p><button type="button" id="shuffle" class="text-button"><span aria-hidden="true">⚄</span> Deal me a mood</button></div>
				<form id="mood-form">
					<div class="phrase-inputs">
						<label class="phrase-field"><span>01 <span>ANY WORD OR PHRASE</span></span><input name="phrase1" id="phrase-1" maxlength="70" placeholder="rainy Sundays" autocomplete="off" required /><i aria-hidden="true">✳</i></label>
						<label class="phrase-field"><span>02 <span>ANOTHER LITTLE INGREDIENT</span></span><input name="phrase2" id="phrase-2" maxlength="70" placeholder="a little strange" autocomplete="off" required /><i aria-hidden="true">✧</i></label>
						<label class="phrase-field"><span>03 <span>AND A TWIST</span></span><input name="phrase3" id="phrase-3" maxlength="70" placeholder="found family" autocomplete="off" required /><i aria-hidden="true">〰</i></label>
					</div>
					<div class="station-bottom"><div class="suggestions"><span>Borrow a mood:</span><button type="button" data-mood="0">soft landing</button><button type="button" data-mood="1">beautifully unhinged</button><button type="button" data-mood="2">out of office</button></div><button class="primary-button" id="find-books" type="submit">Find my next read <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button></div>
				</form>
				<p class="input-hint">No right answers. “Sad robots” is a perfectly good answer.</p>
			</section>

			<p id="request-status" class="request-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
			<div id="error-box" class="error-box" role="alert" hidden><p id="error-message"></p><button id="retry" class="text-button">Try again ↗</button></div>
			<section id="loading" class="loading" aria-label="Finding your books" hidden><div class="loading-books" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><h2 id="loading-line">Wandering through the shelves…</h2><p>A good recommendation deserves a little thought.</p></section>
			<section id="results" class="results" aria-labelledby="shelf-title" hidden>
				<div id="shared-banner" class="shared-banner" hidden><span>✉ A little shelf from a friend. These are their exact picks.</span><button id="remix" class="text-button">Make this mood mine ↗</button></div>
				<div class="results-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow" id="result-eyebrow">THREE BOOKS. THREE WAYS IN.</p><h2 id="shelf-title" tabindex="-1"></h2><p id="shelf-phrases" class="shelf-phrases"></p></div><button id="share-shelf" class="outline-button">Share this mood <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button></div>
				<div id="book-grid" class="book-grid"></div>
				<div class="results-bottom"><p>Good taste is a conversation.<br /><span>Your reactions help us find your kind of good.</span></p><button id="another-round" class="text-button">Three more possibilities <span aria-hidden="true">↻</span></button></div>
			</section>
			<section id="how-it-feels" class="how-it-feels" aria-label="How Next Read works"><p class="eyebrow">A HAPPY ACCIDENT, WITH A LITTLE HELP</p><div class="how-grid"><div><span>01 / THE SPARK</span><p>You bring the mood.<br />We’ll follow the thread.</p></div><div><span>02 / THE UNEXPECTED</span><p>A match. A different angle.<br />One delightful wildcard.</p></div><div><span>03 / THE GROUP CHAT</span><p>Find your kind of book.<br />Send someone their next one.</p></div></div></section>
		</main>
		<footer><a href="/projects">A little experiment by Noah Eisen ↗</a><div><button id="about" class="text-button">Behind the shelves</button><button id="reset-taste" class="text-button">Reset taste notes <span id="taste-count"></span></button></div></footer>
		<div id="toast" class="toast" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></div>
		<dialog id="saved-dialog" aria-labelledby="saved-title"><div class="dialog-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">FOR ANOTHER DAY</p><h2 id="saved-title">Your little shelf</h2></div><button class="close-dialog" aria-label="Close saved books">×</button></div><p class="dialog-note">Saved on this browser. A little pile of possibilities.</p><div id="saved-list"></div></dialog>
		<dialog id="share-dialog" aria-labelledby="share-title"><div class="dialog-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">GOOD BOOKS TRAVEL</p><h2 id="share-title">For the group chat.</h2></div><button class="close-dialog" aria-label="Close sharing">×</button></div><div id="share-preview" class="share-preview"><span>NEXT READ / A LITTLE SHELF</span><h3 id="share-mood-title"></h3><p id="share-phrases"></p><div id="share-titles"></div></div><div class="share-actions"><button id="copy-link" class="primary-button">Copy shelf link ↗</button><button id="download-card" class="outline-button">Save a little postcard ↓</button><button id="native-share" class="text-button" hidden>Send to a friend ↗</button></div><p class="dialog-note">Shares these phrases and these exact picks. Your reactions and saved books stay yours.</p><label id="manual-link-label" hidden>Copy this link<input id="manual-link" readonly /></label></dialog>
		<dialog id="about-dialog" aria-labelledby="about-title"><div class="dialog-heading"><h2 id="about-title">A small shelf. An open mind.</h2><button class="close-dialog" aria-label="Close about">×</button></div><p>This first edition pairs a handpicked, varied shelf of books with AI that follows your three phrases. It’s a bookseller’s starting point, not a search of every book ever written.</p><p>One close match, one different angle, one wildcard. Tell us what you’ve loved or disliked and we’ll use those clues in your next picks. “Not interested” just takes that book out of the running.</p><p>Your phrases and taste reactions go to OpenAI to make recommendations. Saved books and taste notes live in this browser; we don’t keep a reading profile on our server. The service keeps short-lived usage counters to keep this experiment running.</p><p>AI-written connections are interpretations, not guarantees. The little book jackets are our own typographic designs. You can find publisher editions using each book’s link.</p></dialog>
		<noscript><p class="error-box">Next Read needs JavaScript to mix your phrases and find books. Please enable it and reload.</p></noscript>
		<script>import '../../features/next-read/client';</script>
	</body>
</html>
